  "type": "regulation",
  "identifier": "The Minister for Foreign Affairs listed this person on 6 December 2016 under regulation 6(1) of the Autonomous Sanctions Regulations 2011 (AS Regulations). The Minister declared on 4 December 2019, pursuant to regulation 9(3) of the AS Regulations, that this listing would continue to have effect. Relisted on 3 December 2022.",
  "title": "The Minister for Foreign Affairs listed this person on 6 December 2016 under regulation 6(1) of the Autonomous Sanctions Regulations 2011 (AS Regulations). The Minister declared on 4 December 2019, pursuant to regulation 9(3) of the AS Regulations, that this listing would continue to have effect. Relisted on 3 December 2022."
